<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Harbor & Horizon | Hospitality & Tourism</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Luxury hospitality and tourism website for unforgettable stays, curated trips, and local experiences."
    />
    <style>
      :root {
        --bg: #f8f6f1;
        --surface: #ffffff;
        --primary: #0f766e;
        --primary-dark: #0a4f4a;
        --secondary: #f59e0b;
        --text: #1f2937;
        --muted: #6b7280;
        --line: rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.08);
        --shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.12);
        --radius: 22px;
      }

      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      html {
        scroll-behavior: smooth;
      }

      body {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
        background: var(--bg);
        color: var(--text);
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      img {
        max-width: 100%;
        display: block;
      }

      a {
        text-decoration: none;
        color: inherit;
      }

      .container {
        width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 32px));
        margin: 0 auto;
      }

      .section {
        padding: 90px 0;
      }

      .section-head {
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 42px;
      }

      .eyebrow {
        color: var(--primary);
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.12em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        font-size: 12px;
      }

      h1, h2, h3, h4 {
        margin: 0 0 14px;
        line-height: 1.15;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: clamp(2.7rem, 5vw, 5rem);
        letter-spacing: -0.04em;
      }

      h2 {
        font-size: clamp(2rem, 3vw, 3rem);
        letter-spacing: -0.04em;
      }

      p {
        margin: 0 0 18px;
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      .btn {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 16px 28px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        border: none;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
        font-weight: 700;
      }

      .btn:hover {
        transform: translateY(-2px);
      }

      .btn-primary {
        background: var(--primary);
        color: #fff;
        box-shadow: 0 14px 28px rgba(15, 118, 110, 0.28);
      }

      .btn-primary:hover {
        background: var(--primary-dark);
      }

      .btn-secondary {
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.18);
        color: #fff;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.35);
      }

      .topbar {
        position: sticky;
        top: 0;
        z-index: 1000;
        background: rgba(248, 246, 241, 0.8);
        backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      }

      .nav {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        min-height: 78px;
      }

      .brand {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
        font-weight: 800;
        font-size: 1.2rem;
      }

      .brand-mark {
        width: 42px;
        height: 42px;
        border-radius: 14px;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), #14b8a6);
        color: #fff;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        box-shadow: 0 12px 22px rgba(15, 118, 110, 0.25);
      }

      .nav-links {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 28px;
        color: var(--text);
        font-weight: 600;
      }

      .nav-links a {
        position: relative;
      }

      .nav-links a::after {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        left: 0;
        bottom: -8px;
        width: 100%;
        height: 2px;
        background: var(--primary);
        transform: scaleX(0);
        transform-origin: center;
        transition: transform 0.2s ease;
      }

      .nav-links a:hover::after {
        transform: scaleX(1);
      }

      .nav-cta {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
      }

      .menu-toggle {
        display: none;
        background: transparent;
        border: none;
        font-size: 2rem;
        cursor: pointer;
      }

      .hero {
        position: relative;
        background:
          linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(10, 18, 20, 0.74), rgba(10, 18, 20, 0.32)),
          url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507525428034-b723cf961d3e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80') center/cover no-repeat;
        min-height: 760px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        color: #fff;
      }

      .hero-content {
        width: min(680px, 100%);
        padding: 80px 0;
      }

      .hero p {
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        max-width: 560px;
      }

      .hero-actions {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 18px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        margin-top: 26px;
      }

      .stats {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 26px;
        margin-top: 38px;
      }

      .stat {
        min-width: 120px;
      }

      .stat strong {
        display: block;
        font-size: 2rem;
        line-height: 1;
      }

      .stat span {
        color: rgba(255,255,255,0.78);
      }

      .features-grid,
      .destinations-grid,
      .services-grid,
      .testimonials-grid,
      .contact-grid {
        display: grid;
        gap: 26px;
      }

      .features-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
      }

      .feature-card {
        background: var(--surface);
        border-radius: var(--radius);
        padding: 28px 22px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        box-shadow: 0 8px 18px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);
      }

      .icon-box {
        width: 64px;
        height: 64px;
        border-radius: 18px;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        font-size: 1.7rem;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        background: rgba(15, 118, 110, 0.08);
        color: var(--primary);
      }

      .feature-card h3 {
        font-size: 1.3rem;
      }

      .destinations-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      }

      .destination-card {
        position: relative;
        border-radius: var(--radius);
        overflow: hidden;
        min-height: 440px;
        background: #d1d5db;
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      }

      .destination-card img {
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        object-fit: cover;
      }

      .destination-overlay {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(2,6,23,0.05), rgba(2,6,23,0.76));
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: flex-end;
        padding: 24px;
        color: #fff;
      }

      .destination-overlay h3 {
        font-size: 1.7rem;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
      }

      .destination-meta {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
        color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8);
      }

      .pricing {
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.14);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
        padding: 8px 12px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        font-weight: 700;
      }

      .package-card {
        background: var(--surface);
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: var(--radius);
        overflow: hidden;
        box-shadow: 0 12px 25px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05);
      }

      .package-card img {
        height: 240px;
        width: 100%;
        object-fit: cover;
      }

      .package-body {
        padding: 24px;
      }

      .package-top {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
      }

      .tag {
        background: rgba(15, 118, 110, 0.08);
        color: var(--primary);
        border-radius: 999px;
        padding: 6px 10px;
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 700;
      }

      .price {
        font-size: 1.7rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        color: var(--text);
      }

      .package-list {
        list-style: none;
        padding: 0;
        margin: 0 0 20px;
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      .package-list li::before {
        content: "✓ ";
        color: var(--primary);
        font-weight: 800;
      }

      .services {
        background: #f1efe8;
      }

      .services-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      }

      .service-card {
        padding: 30px 24px;
        background: #fff;
        border-radius: var(--radius);
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
      }

      .service-card .icon-box {
        width: 58px;
        height: 58px;
        border-radius: 16px;
      }

      .testimonials-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      }

      .testimonial {
        background: var(--surface);
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: var(--radius);
        padding: 28px 22px;
      }

      .stars {
        color: var(--secondary);
        letter-spacing: 0.18em;
        margin-bottom: 18px;
      }

      .person {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 14px;
        margin-top: 24px;
      }

      .person img {
        width: 52px;
        height: 52px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        object-fit: cover;
      }

      .person small {
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      .cta {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f766e 0%, #0a4f4a 100%);
        border-radius: 28px;
        padding: 52px 40px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 28px;
        color: #fff;
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      }

      .cta p {
        color: rgba(255,255,255,0.78);
        margin-bottom: 0;
      }

      .contact-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
        align-items: start;
      }

      .contact-card,
      .info-card {
        background: var(--surface);
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: var(--radius);
        padding: 30px;
      }

      form {
        display: grid;
        gap: 16px;
      }

      .field-row {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 16px;
      }

      input, textarea {
        width: 100%;
        border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.5);
        background: #fff;
        border-radius: 14px;
        padding: 16px 18px;
        font: inherit;
        color: var(--text);
      }

      textarea {
        min-height: 140px;
        resize: vertical;
      }

      .info-list {
        list-style: none;
        padding: 0;
        margin: 22px 0 0;
        display: grid;
        gap: 18px;
      }

      .info-list li {
        display: flex;
        align-items: flex-start;
        gap: 14px;
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      .info-icon {
        width: 42px;
        height: 42px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        background: rgba(15, 118, 110, 0.08);
        color: var(--primary);
      }

      footer {
        background: #0a1017;
        color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75);
        padding: 26px 0;
      }

      .footer-inner {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 18px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
      }

      @media (max-width: 980px) {
        .features-grid,
        .services-grid,
        .destinations-grid,
        .testimonials-grid,
        .contact-grid {
          grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
        }

        .nav-links {
          position: absolute;
          left: 16px;
          right: 16px;
          top: 82px;
          display: none;
          flex-direction: column;
          align-items: flex-start;
          gap: 18px;
          padding: 18px 20px;
          background: rgba(255,255,255,0.96);
          border: 1px solid var(--line);
          border-radius: 18px;
          box-shadow: var(--shadow);
        }

        .nav-links.open {
          display: flex;
        }

        .menu-toggle {
          display: block;
        }
      }

      @media (max-width: 680px) {
        .features-grid,
        .services-grid,
        .destinations-grid,
        .testimonials-grid,
        .contact-grid,
        .field-row {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }

        .nav-cta {
          display: none;
        }

        .hero {
          min-height: 640px;
        }

        .cta {
          flex-direction: column;
          align-items: flex-start;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="topbar">
      <div class="container nav">
        <div class="brand" aria-label="Harbor and Horizon brand">
          <div class="brand-mark">H</div>
          <span>Harbor &amp; Horizon</span>
        </div>

        <nav class="nav-links" id="navLinks" aria-label="Main navigation">
          <a href="#about">About</a>
          <a href="#destinations">Destinations</a>
          <a href="#packages">Packages</a>
          <a href="#services">Services</a>
          <a href="#reviews">Reviews</a>
          <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
        </nav>

        <div class="nav-cta">
          <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary">Book a Trip</a>
        </div>

        <button class="menu-toggle" id="menuToggle" aria-label="Open menu">☰</button>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="hero" id="about">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="hero-content">
            <div class="eyebrow">Curated experiences</div>
            <h1>Travel beautifully. Stay memorably.</h1>
            <p>
              We design refined hospitality and tourism experiences for travelers seeking
              comfort, culture, and connection across breathtaking destinations.
            </p>

            <div class="hero-actions">
              <a href="#packages" class="btn btn-primary">Explore Packages</a>
              <a href="#destinations" class="btn btn-secondary">View Destinations</a>
            </div>

            <div class="stats" aria-label="Company statistics">
              <div class="stat">
                <strong>28k+</strong>
                <span>Happy guests</span>
              </div>
              <div class="stat">
                <strong>160+</strong>
                <span>Properties</span>
              </div>
              <div class="stat">
                <strong>48</strong>
                <span>Countries</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="section-head">
            <div class="eyebrow">Why choose us</div>
            <h2>Hospitality built around your journey</h2>
          </div>

          <div class="features-grid">
            <article class="feature-card">
              <div class="icon-box">✦</div>
              <h3>Luxury stays</h3>
              <p>Handpicked boutique hotels, seaside resorts, and private villas for a lavish escape.</p>
            </article>

            <article class="feature-card">
              <div class="icon-box">◎</div>
              <h3>Tailored itineraries</h3>
              <p>Every itinerary is designed around your interests, pace, and travel style.</p>
            </article>

            <article class="feature-card">
              <div class="icon-box">☼</div>
              <h3>Local immersion</h3>
              <p>Discover authentic dining, hidden gems, and regional experiences that feel personal.</p>
            </article>

            <article class="feature-card">
              <div class="icon-box">★</div>
              <h3>Concierge care</h3>
              <p>Our dedicated team handles logistics, transfers, and memorable on-ground support.</p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section" id="destinations">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="section-head">
            <div class="eyebrow">Popular routes</div>
            <h2>Explore dream destinations</h2>
          </div>

          <div class="destinations-grid">
            <article class="destination-card">
              <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1501785888041-af3ef285b470?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80" alt="Santorini coastline" />
              <div class="destination-overlay">
                <h3>Santorini</h3>
                <div class="destination-meta">
                  <span>Greece</span>
                  <span class="pricing">From $899</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </article>

            <article class="destination-card">
              <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1493246507139-91e8fad9978e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80" alt="Swiss Alps" />
              <div class="destination-overlay">
                <h3>Swiss Alps</h3>
                <div class="destination-meta">
                  <span>Switzerland</span>
                  <span class="pricing">From $1,280</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </article>

            <article class="destination-card">
              <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519046904884-53103b34b206?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80" alt="Bali beach" />
              <div class="destination-overlay">
                <h3>Bali</h3>
                <div class="destination-meta">
                  <span>Indonesia</span>
                  <span class="pricing">From $760</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section" id="packages">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="section-head">
            <div class="eyebrow">Signature packages</div>
            <h2>Plan your perfect getaway</h2>
          </div>

          <div class="destinations-grid">
            <article class="package-card">
              <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1527631746610-bca00a040d60?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80" alt="Beach resort package" />
              <div class="package-body">
                <div class="package-top">
                  <span class="tag">Beach Escape</span>
                  <span class="price">$1,250</span>
                </div>
                <h3>Maldives Retreat</h3>
                <ul class="package-list">
                  <li>4-night luxury villa stay</li>
                  <li>Private island transfer</li>
                  <li>Sunset dinner & spa access</li>
                </ul>
                <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary">Reserve now</a>
              </div>
            </article>

            <article class="package-card">
              <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506973035872-a4ec16b8e8d9?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80" alt="Mountain adventure package" />
              <div class="package-body">
                <div class="package-top">
                  <span class="tag">Adventure</span>
                  <span class="price">$1,680</span>
                </div>
                <h3>Alpine Journey</h3>
                <ul class="package-list">
                  <li>Hiking & scenic rail tour</li>
                  <li>Chalet accommodation</li>
                  <li>Local cheese tasting</li>
                </ul>
                <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary">Reserve now</a>
              </div>
            </article>

            <article class="package-card">
              <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500530855697-b586d89ba3ee?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80" alt="Cultural city package" />
              <div class="package-body">
                <div class="package-top">
                  <span class="tag">City & Culture</span>
                  <span class="price">$980</span>
                </div>
                <h3>Paris Discovery</h3>
                <ul class="package-list">
                  <li>Elegant boutique hotel</li>
                  <li>Guided museum tour</li>
                  <li>Chef-led culinary experience</li>
                </ul>
                <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary">Reserve now</a>
              </div>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section services" id="services">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="section-head">
            <div class="eyebrow">What we offer</div>
            <h2>Full-spectrum hospitality support</h2>
          </div>

          <div class="services-grid">
            <article class="service-card">
              <div class="icon-box">⌂</div>
              <h3>Hotel booking</h3>
              <p>Access premium rooms, resorts, and villas in high-demand destinations worldwide.</p>
            </article>

            <article class="service-card">
              <div class="icon-box">✈</div>
              <h3>Travel planning</h3>
              <p>From flights to transport and excursions, we handle every detail for seamless travel.</p>
            </article>

            <article class="service-card">
              <div class="icon-box">♢</div>
              <h3>Event hosting</h3>
              <p>Curate business retreats, destination weddings, and sophisticated group experiences.</p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section" id="reviews">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="section-head">
            <div class="eyebrow">Guest stories</div>
            <h2>Travelers love the experience</h2>
          </div>

          <div class="testimonials-grid">
            <article class="testimonial">
              <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
              <p>“The attention to detail was extraordinary. Every day felt effortless, beautiful, and deeply personal.”</p>
              <div class="person">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1494790108377-be9c29b29330?auto=format&fit=crop&w=200&q=80" alt="Alicia profile" />
                <div>
                  <strong>Alicia T.</strong><br />
                  <small>Couples getaway</small>
                </div>
              </div>
            </article>

            <article class="testimonial">
              <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
              <p>“From flights to villa check-in, everything ran flawlessly. We felt cared for from day one.”</p>
              <div class="person">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500648767791-00dcc994a43e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=200&q=80" alt="Marcus profile" />
                <div>
                  <strong>Marcus L.</strong><br />
                  <small>Adventure traveler</small>
                </div>
              </div>
            </article>

            <article class="testimonial">
              <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
              <p>“Our family trip was perfectly paced and beautifully organized. The local experiences were unforgettable.”</p>
              <div class="person">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1487412720507-e7ab37603c6f?auto=format&fit=crop&w=200&q=80" alt="Nadia profile" />
                <div>
                  <strong>Nadia R.</strong><br />
                  <small>Family vacation</small>
                </div>
              </div>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="cta">
            <div>
              <div class="eyebrow" style="color:#d7f6f3;">Plan your next escape</div>
              <h2 style="color:#fff; margin-bottom:0;">Let us create a journey worth remembering.</h2>
            </div>
            <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-secondary" style="font-size:1rem;">Start planning</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section" id="contact">
